blueprint-cljs
A ClojureScript/Reagent re-implementation of the Blueprint UI toolkit.

Design, styles, component APIs and icons are derived from Blueprint
(https://github.com/palantir/blueprint), Copyright Palantir Technologies, Inc.,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Ported from commit
f301ba5eed104576262090b9416fd6a4b91aab1b (@blueprintjs/core 6.22.0).

scripts/css/vendor/react-day-picker/_style.scss is the stylesheet of react-day-picker
8.10.1 (https://github.com/gpbl/react-day-picker), Copyright Giampaolo Bellavite and
contributors, MIT license (scripts/css/vendor/react-day-picker/LICENSE); Blueprint's
datetime SCSS imports it, so it is compiled into resources/blueprint_cljs/css/datetime.css.
